    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "The primary purpose of this study is to evaluate XL092 + atezolizumab versus regorafenib in participants with microsatellite stable/microsatellite instability low (MSS/MSI-low) metastatic colorectal cancer (mCRC) who have progressed during, after or are intolerant to standard-of-care (SOC) therapy."
    },
